ImitFly research code

This release includes selected FlyBody source files and mesh/XML assets from the
local research project, derived from https://github.com/TuragaLab/flybody.
FlyBody was developed by HHMI Janelia Research Campus and Google DeepMind.
The original Apache License 2.0 is retained in LICENSE, and the original project
README is retained in docs/FLYBODY_UPSTREAM_README.md. Existing file notices are
preserved. The upstream commit of this local copy could not be established
because the source folder has no readable Git history.

ImitFly policy and experimental software are attributed to Ao Wang, Ziyu Liu,
Yingjie He, Xiaopeng Sha, and Shuyu Wang. This derivative release uses the
existing project Apache License 2.0. Checkpoint binaries, expert policies,
datasets, wingbeat data, and manuscript drafts are not distributed here.

See docs/SOURCE_MAP.md for the main source-to-release mapping.
Local FlyBody task/asset files may already contain research modifications;
"copied unchanged" means unchanged relative to the local source, not upstream.
